Description: CamVistra camera application for Linux (PyQt5)
 CamVistra is a camera application for Linux developed by e-con Systems.
 It supports e-con USB, network (ONVIF/RTSP) and Wi-Fi cameras with
 preview, still capture, video recording, histogram and diagnostics.
 .
 This package contains the PyQt5 application and the camera SDK
 libraries it uses.
